 "title": "1N4001 to 1N4007: 1 A general purpose plastic rectifiers, 50 V to 1000 V, DO-41",
 "source": {
  "document": "Document Number 88503",
  "revision": "29-Apr-2020",
  "pages": 5
 },
 "summary": "A family of seven 1 A silicon rectifier diodes in the axial DO-41 (DO-204AL) molded package, differing only in reverse voltage rating, from 50 V (1N4001) to 1000 V (1N4007). Forward drop is 1.1 V max at 1 A, reverse leakage 5 µA max at rated voltage and 25 °C, and an 8.3 ms half sine surge of 30 A is allowed. Intended uses are power supply rectification, inverters, converters and freewheeling. 1N4001-E3/54 is the 50 V type, RoHS-compliant commercial grade, on 13-inch paper tape and reel.",
